Build ubuntu noble, qesting, resolute images for rpi4b, rpi5, opi5, rockpi4b and rk3328:

Input files: ../kernel/linux-${CHIP}/tmp/boot/*
             ../kernel/linux-${CHIP}/tmp/lib/modules/*

cd ~/build-5sbc/ubuntu
sudo ln -s gutsy /usr/share/debootstrap/scripts/resolute
sudo ln -s gutsy /usr/share/debootstrap/scripts/questing
make clean
make SUITE=resolute rootfs_base
make SUITE=resolute CHIP=rockpi4b finalize
DISTRIBUTION=resolute CHIP=rockpi4b ./mk-espimage.sh 
./mk-image.sh

Plugin NVMe SSD/usb3 stick to PC.
sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh

Plugin NVMe SSD/usb3 stick to sbc. For rk3328 put sdcard with uboot-uefi image to rk3328.
Plugin ethernet cable to opi5 and rk3328.
(rpi4b) Esc -> Device Manager -> Rpi -> Advanced -> 3GB ( disable ) -> F10 -> Boot Manager -> first UEFI or SDCARD.
Login:
Username: linaro
Password: linaro
Setup wifi. Disable power saving, auto suspend and screen saver.
sudo apt update
sudo apt install net-tools openssh-server pulseaudio-utils
sudo ifconfig
ssh-keygen -R 192.168.86.28
ssh linaro@192.168.86.28
df .
sudo resize2fs /dev/sda2  ( for NVMe SSD /dev/nvme0n1p2 )
df .
uname -a
lsb_release -a
sudo dpkg-reconfigure tzdata
sudo dpkg-reconfigure locales
date
sudo apt update
sudo apt upgrade
sync
free

sudo apt install python3-pip python3-setuptools ffmpeg mpv glmark2-es2-wayland pandoc vlc vlc-plugin-video-output vsftpd speedtest-cli

speedtest-cli --secure

glmark2-es2-wayland

aplay -l
pavucontrol  ( select hdmi as default )

(noble, resolute) sudo add-apt-repository ppa:mozillateam/ppa
(noble, resolute) sudo apt update; sudo apt upgrade -y;
(noble, resolute) sudo apt install firefox-esr
(noble, resolute) firefox -> youtube.com -> search YmDNhi07_Ho

Do follows on PC, then ftp swan.mp4 to sbc.
(
git clone https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp.git
cd yt-dlp
make
cd ../
(rk3328) ~/yt-dlp/yt-dlp -f 'bestvideo[ext=mp4]+bestaudio[ext=m4a]' 3qrKjywjo7Q -o "temp_%(id)s.%(ext)s" --exec "ffmpeg -y -i {} -vf scale=1024:640 -r 10 -b:v 2M -c:a copy swan.mp4 && rm {}"
(opi5,rpi5,rockpi4b,rpi4b) ~/yt-dlp/yt-dlp -f 'bestvideo[ext=mp4]+bestaudio[ext=m4a]' 3qrKjywjo7Q -o swan.mp4
)

mpv swan.mp4
ffplay -autoexit swan.mp4
cvlc --gl=wgl --glconv=any swan.mp4

Except rockpi4b, Plugin ASUS USB-BT500 bluetooth usb dongle to sbc.
hciconfig hci0
hcitool dev
hciconfig -a

